      "text": [
        " جِنَازَةِ سَعْدِ بْنِ مُعَاذٍ رَحِمَهُ اَللَّهُ فَسُئِلَ عَنْ ذَلِكَ فَقَالَ «إِنِّي رَأَيْتُ اَلْمَلاَئِكَةَ قَدْ وَضَعَتْ أَرْدِيَتَهَا فَوَضَعْتُ رِدَائِي."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.512 - \"The Messenger of Allah (sw) placed his cloak down during the funeral of Sa'd ibn Mu'adh (may Allah (swt) have mercy on him).\nWhen asked about this, He (sw) said:\n\"I saw the angels had placed their cloaks down, so I placed mine as well.\""
        ]
      }
